{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/c01.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/c01.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "c01_school_03",
      "hash64": "2EFC1A76716B2CCA",
      "text": "學院裡超出名的地獄樓梯！\\n爬起來很累人對吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "c01_school_05",
      "hash64": "2EFC1476716B2298",
      "text": "桌台市是學校與文化的城鎮！\\n這地方就像桌子一樣寬廣。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "c01_school_09",
      "hash64": "2EFC1076716B1BCC",
      "text": "學校裡有各式各樣的\\n人和寶可夢喔！\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也是各式各樣的其中之一！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "c01_school_16",
      "hash64": "2EF915767168EE74",
      "text": "天星隊的人感覺有點可怕呢～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "c01_school_17",
      "hash64": "2EF916767168F027",
      "text": "聽說天星隊的人每天晚上\\n都會騎著奇怪的車飆來飆去的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "c01_northwest_06",
      "hash64": "7D8AA2BF4AF114E1",
      "text": "在學院裡學生們可以選\\n自己喜歡的課來上，對吧？\\r\\n最近的學校還真是不一樣啊～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "c01_northwest_10",
      "hash64": "7D871EBF4AEDFEBE",
      "text": "喂？本校的學生大家都是好孩子，\\n真的是幫了大忙。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "c01_northwest_16",
      "hash64": "7D8720BF4AEE0224",
      "text": "真不愧是帕底亞最大的都市！\\n我完全迷路啦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "c01_northwest_17",
      "hash64": "7D8721BF4AEE03D7",
      "text": "地圖上綠色指的是北方喔。\\c\\n試試看按壓Ｒ操控搖桿，\\n把北方固定成朝上如何？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "c01_northwest_27",
      "hash64": "7D8411BF4AEBB2D0",
      "text": "寶可夢聯盟就在\\n隧道的另一頭。\\c\\n在那裡可以接受為了\\n成為冠軍級的測驗，對吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "c01_northwest_28",
      "hash64": "7D8420BF4AEBCC4D",
      "text": "我去寶可夢聯盟\\n接受了面試測驗！\\r\\n面試官……超可怕的啦～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "c01_northwest_32",
      "hash64": "7D8094BF4AE8A892",
      "text": "城鎮的外面有很多\\n沒看過的寶可夢呢～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "c01_northwest_40",
      "hash64": "7D7D0CBF4AE58BA3",
      "text": "超級模特兒，莉普！\\n聽說她和學校裡的\\r\\n某個老師是兒時玩伴喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "c01_park_01",
      "hash64": "08DF734206A833F0",
      "text": "前方的岩山錯綜複雜！\\n那裡很容易迷路，要小心啊。\\c\\n穿過岩山之後，\\n就是藝術的城鎮，深缽鎮喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "c01_park_07",
      "hash64": "08DF794206A83E22",
      "text": "是知名的博士解明了\\n寶可夢的太晶化現象，對吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "c01_park_08",
      "hash64": "08DF7C4206A8433B",
      "text": "聽說那位博士……\\n在帕底亞巨坑做很驚人的研究。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "c01_park_10",
      "hash64": "08DC0E4206A5527A",
      "text": "睡得飽～飽的話，\\n就會到能去上學的那天囉。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "c01_park_11",
      "hash64": "08DC0F4206A5542D",
      "text": "我也想快點\\n到學院～上課～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "c01_park_16",
      "hash64": "08DC084206A54848",
      "text": "時間會流逝……\\n天氣會變化……\\c\\n聽說野生寶可夢的行動\\n會隨著時間和天氣改變。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "c01_park_20",
      "hash64": "08D8884206A238F1",
      "text": "好大的水池～！\\c\\n好想像鯉魚王一樣\\n在水面上漂啊漂的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "c01_park_25",
      "hash64": "08D88B4206A23E0A",
      "text": "學校的老師總會被\\n取一些奇怪的綽號。\\c\\n比如說「阿朔」啦～「賽吉兄」啦～之類的，\\n學生們在聊天的時候我聽到了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "c01_park_29",
      "hash64": "08D87F4206A229A6",
      "text": "根據不同的寶可夢，\\n也會有各自無法學會的招式呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "c01_park_38",
      "hash64": "08D57A42069FEB50",
      "text": "我想要太晶珠，\\n但是成績不夠好……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "c01_park_39",
      "hash64": "08D57B42069FED03",
      "text": "只有優秀的學生\\n才能拿到太晶珠喔。\\r\\n因為它的力量實在太強了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "c01_center_south_01",
      "hash64": "D6E7A27424DC26F1",
      "text": "這裡是桌台市，\\n是帕底亞最大的城鎮！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "c01_center_south_15",
      "hash64": "D6EB227424DF3648",
      "text": "薩哥的家政課非常有用喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "c01_center_south_16",
      "hash64": "D6EB257424DF3B61",
      "text": "蕾荷老師的歷史課超有趣的～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "c01_center_south_31",
      "hash64": "D6E49A7424D9E382",
      "text": "今天要去哪一間\\n三明治店吃東西好呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "c01_center_south_32",
      "hash64": "D6E4997424D9E1CF",
      "text": "就算是同樣的店，在不同的地方\\n販賣的商品也會有微妙的不同。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "c01_center_south_44",
      "hash64": "D6DA257424D0C82E",
      "text": "在市街上的寶可夢\\n通常都是別人的夥伴，\\r\\n所以不能亂捉喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "c01_center_south_93",
      "hash64": "D6D0187424C85D92",
      "text": "我的寶可夢對聲音很敏感！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "c01_center_south_94",
      "hash64": "D6D0137424C85513",
      "text": "即使是相同的寶可夢，\\n性格、特性和實力也不盡相同。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "c01_center_south_100",
      "hash64": "10D3015AA757FDB5",
      "text": "帕底亞的雨既不冰冷也不會下不停，\\n所以我都不撐傘的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "c01_center_north_33",
      "hash64": "760EED392C2EE996",
      "text": "我兒子好像加入了天星隊喔～\\n那應該是很快樂的社團吧～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "c01_center_north_40",
      "hash64": "761272392C32016C",
      "text": "中央廣場的對戰場！\\c\\n因為會受到大家矚目，\\n沒自信的話根本不敢用那個地方呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "c01_center_north_41",
      "hash64": "761273392C32031F",
      "text": "聽說其他的地區，\\n冠軍只有１個人！\\c\\n在帕底亞的話冠軍級有好幾個人，\\n很厲害吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "c01_center_north_54",
      "hash64": "7615F4392C351429",
      "text": "我不喜歡上網買東西……\\n還是看過實際的商品之後再買才安心。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "c01_center_north_82",
      "hash64": "75E96C392C0EF226",
      "text": "妳知道嗎？\\n最多可以帶６隻寶可夢一起同行喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "c01_center_north_83",
      "hash64": "75E96D392C0EF3D9",
      "text": "沒辦法帶上的寶可夢\\n會被送到盒子裡，對吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "c01_center_north_91",
      "hash64": "75ECEF392C120696",
      "text": "到處撿寶可夢的掉落物，\\n再用交換來的ＬＰ支付……\\r\\n這麼一來就算沒有錢，也能買想要的東西！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "c01_center_north_94",
      "hash64": "75ECF4392C120F15",
      "text": "桌台市是學問之城～♪\\n學院是我的母校～啦啦啦～♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "c01_stairs_03",
      "hash64": "0AE4BF2F2473DF1C",
      "text": "學校入口大廳書架上的那些書，\\n通通都能自由閱讀！\\r\\n對喜歡看書的人來說，實在是太幸福了～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "c01_stairs_08",
      "hash64": "0AE4CA2F2473F1CD",
      "text": "我是學院的畢業生！\\n現在還有那個叫尋寶的活動嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "c01_stairs_22",
      "hash64": "0AEB502F2479412D",
      "text": "學院沒有年齡限制！\\n聽說老奶奶也能入學！\\r\\n……我也回學院去重讀好了？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "c01_square_01",
      "hash64": "A76B1F56A83A18B9",
      "text": "前面是西門。\\n要去圓模鎮的話就走西門！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "c01_square_02",
      "hash64": "A76B1C56A83A13A0",
      "text": "西門在那邊的那條路上！\\n要從罐頭店的旁邊經過。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "c01_square_03",
      "hash64": "A76B1D56A83A1553",
      "text": "前面是條死路！\\n那裡只有九八酒吧喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "c01_square_14",
      "hash64": "A76EA056A83D29C3",
      "text": "來做校外研究的準備好了！\\n信使鳥包包在哪裡來著？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "c01_square_15",
      "hash64": "A76E9F56A83D2810",
      "text": "信使鳥包包有幾間店鋪，\\n往南走的話很快就能看到了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "c01_square_16",
      "hash64": "A76EA256A83D2D29",
      "text": "只要看得見寶可夢中心，我就覺得放心。\\n……那裡播放的音樂也很棒。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "c01_square_17",
      "hash64": "A76EA156A83D2B76",
      "text": "只要是去過１次的寶可夢中心，\\n搭飛翔計程車就能立刻前往喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "c01_southeast_04",
      "hash64": "7325B69DA7C89897",
      "text": "城鎮和城市有什麼不一樣……\\n大小嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "c01_southeast_05",
      "hash64": "7325B59DA7C896E4",
      "text": "在帕底亞地區，\\n叫「～市」的地方有３個！\\r\\n其中１個就是這裡，桌台市。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "c01_southeast_08",
      "hash64": "7325AA9DA7C88433",
      "text": "我聽說這附近有人\\n在賣很稀有的三明治……\\r\\n不曉得在哪裡呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "c01_southeast_17",
      "hash64": "7322A79DA7C64943",
      "text": "三明治好好吃～！\\n我每天都想吃～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "c01_southeast_18",
      "hash64": "7322B49DA7C65F5A",
      "text": "呵呵呵！\\n下次要不要一起做料理呀？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "c01_southeast_27",
      "hash64": "731F279DA7C339EC",
      "text": "北邊住宅區林立！\\c\\n聽說如果是住在桌台市的學生，\\n想住學生宿舍是會被學校給拒絕的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "c01_southeast_40",
      "hash64": "7333AA9DA7D4C18F",
      "text": "光是看到別人帶著寶可夢一起走，\\n我就覺得好療癒喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "c01_southeast_43",
      "hash64": "7333AB9DA7D4C342",
      "text": "三明治真好吃！\\n尤其這間店的三明治更是好吃好吃！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "c01_southeast_45",
      "hash64": "7333A59DA7D4B910",
      "text": "在信使鳥包包買手機殼的話，\\n就能改變手機洛托姆的外觀！\\r\\n嗯～要選哪一個好呢……真煩惱！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "c01_southwest_06",
      "hash64": "3E6DD937806A447F",
      "text": "有一天等我捉到寶可夢，\\n我要成為冠軍級～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "c01_southwest_12",
      "hash64": "3E6AD33780680476",
      "text": "學校裡現在流行星型的太陽眼鏡嗎？\\n我看到有集團戴著那種眼鏡呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "c01_southwest_19",
      "hash64": "3E6ADA378068105B",
      "text": "對戰場的顏色或外觀\\n會隨城鎮而有不同喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "c01_southwest_23",
      "hash64": "3E74E437807075DE",
      "text": "寶可夢中心的姐姐在幫忙回復的時候，\\n都會告訴我一些小知識。\\r\\n……只有我擁有這種特別待遇嗎！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "c01_southwest_29",
      "hash64": "3E74DA37807064E0",
      "text": "我讓帕奇利茲攜帶\\n我在信使鳥包包買的道具！\\c\\n按照攜帶的道具，\\n可是會有各式各樣的加強效果！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "c01_southwest_31",
      "hash64": "3E715E37806D5C55",
      "text": "先制之爪！讓寶可夢攜帶的話，\\n有時候會有讓人開心的事發生喔！\\r\\n那邊那間紅色的商店有在賣！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "c01_southwest_36",
      "hash64": "3E715737806D5070",
      "text": "從西門出去一～直走的話，\\n就能走到圓模鎮！\\r\\n現在正好是豐收祭的時期呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "label": "c01_southwest_53",
      "hash64": "3E786C37807392CD",
      "text": "青銅鐘好有魅力……\\c\\n有時候我會進去鐘裡面，\\n很神奇地一進去就覺得內心平靜。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "label": "c01_southwest_60",
      "hash64": "3E825B37807BCA6F",
      "text": "我迷路了。\\n還是看看地圖App好了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "label": "c01_southwest_61",
      "hash64": "3E825A37807BC8BC",
      "text": "吃了這裡的料理，\\n就會充滿蛋蛋力喔。\\c\\n在野餐時就會更容易找到寶可夢的蛋。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "label": "c01_northeast_04",
      "hash64": "4F8F0471D0339599",
      "text": "寶可夢的掉落物在招式學習器機\\n可以交換成ＬＰ喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "label": "c01_northeast_08",
      "hash64": "4F8F1071D033A9FD",
      "text": "最近的機器動不動就會說話！\\n招式學習器機也會發出聲音呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "label": "c01_northeast_09",
      "hash64": "4F8F0F71D033A84A",
      "text": "帕奇利茲的特性是逃跑！\\n牠很擅長從野生寶可夢的手中逃走！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "label": "c01_northeast_23",
      "hash64": "4F961571D039D12A",
      "text": "最近的自動販賣機\\n用ＬＰ也能買飲料呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "label": "c01_northeast_24",
      "hash64": "4F961071D039C8AB",
      "text": "學校的樓梯實在太長了，\\n所以有「地獄樓梯」這個稱號。\\r\\n上下學的學生們的確很辛苦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "label": "c01_northeast_37",
      "hash64": "4F929171D036BB07",
      "text": "野生寶可夢在睡覺時就是機會！\\n可以出其不意地先發制人！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "label": "c01_northeast_38",
      "hash64": "4F928671D036A856",
      "text": "看到寶可夢在睡覺的模樣，\\n我就會忍不住拍照拍到停不下來。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "label": "c01_northeast_47",
      "hash64": "4F819171D02847D4",
      "text": "新任校長是克拉韋爾對吧？\\n我記得他是在１年半前就任的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "label": "c01_northeast_54",
      "hash64": "4F7E0E71D0253364",
      "text": "學生會長妮莫是個好孩子。\\n我們擦身而過時，她總是會向我打招呼。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "label": "c01_northeast_71",
      "hash64": "4F851771D02B615D",
      "text": "要是遇到了優美的景色，\\n別忘了用相機App拍下照片吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "label": "c01_other_01_01",
      "hash64": "EE1CAC64C5141708",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也喜歡在屋頂上\\n休息發呆嗎？\\r\\n不過要小心別掉下去了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "label": "c01_center_north_99",
      "hash64": "75ECF7392C12142E",
      "text": "這間店有在賣顏色不同的\\n學校指定的包包啊。\\r\\n要選哪個顏色好呢～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "label": "c01_center_north_100",
      "hash64": "B8836226098752B3",
      "text": "我要去美髮沙龍換個髮型，\\n你在這附近打發時間吧～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "label": "c01_center_north_101",
      "hash64": "B883612609875100",
      "text": "有些髮型的名字聽起來\\n就像寶可夢的招式一樣。\\r\\n比如說旁分或是低盤髮之類的……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "label": "c01_center_north_102",
      "hash64": "B883642609875619",
      "text": "我到眼鏡鄉買副眼鏡，\\n試試看人生第一次戴眼鏡的造型好了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "label": "c01_center_north_103",
      "hash64": "B883632609875466",
      "text": "我想戴頂時尚的帽子！\\n但又想秀出我的髮型！\\r\\n……總之還是先進店裡再煩惱吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "label": "c01_center_north_104",
      "hash64": "B88366260987597F",
      "text": "容易手腳冰冷的話，選厚襪子就對了！\\n這間店有各式各樣的款式喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "label": "c01_square_28",
      "hash64": "A7642A56A8340CBC",
      "text": "有水果還有蔬菜……\\n連米飯都有！？\\c\\n我要在罐頭王大買特買食材，\\n狂做三明治了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
